  "narrative": {
    "intro": "General Motors obligated $633M in FY2026 to date under federal contracts. General Motors recorded 13,904 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $45.5K. General Motors obligations are up 124.6% year over year. Historical obligations show variation across recent fiscal years: FY21 $187M, FY22 $188M, FY23 $260M, FY24 $182M, and FY25 $282M. Current-year totals are partial and cover the fiscal year to date. The page notes that all figures are contract obligations except award-value figures in the largest-awards and expiring-contracts tables, which are total contract values. The numbers above are obligations and counts reported for General Motors through FY2026 to date. Use the fiscal-year series to see where obligations rose and fell over the last six years. The award count and average award size summarize transaction volume and scale for General Motors in the current fiscal period.",
